      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.173309326171875,
        245.26596069335938,
        73.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "4.4\t Management of neonatal jaundice",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        76.79890441894531,
        399.0728454589844,
        90.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Term and preterm newbors with hyperbilirubinaemia should be treated with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        89.79890441894531,
        399.04150390625,
        103.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "phototherapy or exchange transfusion guided by the following cut-off levels of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        102.79890441894531,
        184.56146240234375,
        116.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "serum hyperbilirubinaemia:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        345.654296875,
        143.59451293945312,
        379.1843566894531,
        151.65151977539062
      ],
      "text": "NEWBORNS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.31781005859375,
        154.59451293945312,
        394.52178955078125,
        162.65151977539062
      ],
      "text": "<35 WEEKS GESTATION",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        165.59439086914062,
        392.4008483886719,
        173.65139770507812
      ],
      "text": "AGE OR ANY RISK FACTORS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        342.77099609375,
        178.84341430664062,
        382.51495361328125,
        189.20242309570312
      ],
      "text": "220 mmol/l",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        184.34341430664062,
        86.31950378417969,
        194.70242309570312
      ],
      "text": "Day 1",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        343.7582092285156,
        189.84341430664062,
        379.5332336425781,
        200.20242309570312
      ],
      "text": "(10 mg/dL)",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        342.76470947265625,
        204.98040771484375,
        382.5176696777344,
        215.33941650390625
      ],
      "text": "260 mmol/l",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03160095214844,
        210.48040771484375,
        86.3196029663086,
        220.83941650390625
      ],
      "text": "Day 2",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        343.76580810546875,
        215.98040771484375,
        379.5318298339844,
        226.33941650390625
      ],
      "text": "(15 mg/dL)",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        342.7048034667969,
        231.11740112304688,
        382.5837707519531,
        241.47640991210938
      ],
      "text": "340 mmol/l",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        236.61740112304688,
        91.4990005493164,
        247.8043975830078
      ],
      "text": "Day  3 ≥",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        343.5255126953125,
        242.11740112304688,
        379.759521484375,
        252.47640991210938
      ],
      "text": "(20 mg/dL)",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        266.2413024902344,
        269.5429382324219,
        280.16131591796875
      ],
      "text": "(Weak recommendation, very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        282.5058898925781,
        399.10284423828125,
        295.99591064453125
      ],
      "text": "b)\tClinicians should ensure that all newborns are routinely monitored for the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        295.5058898925781,
        399.13140869140625,
        308.99591064453125
      ],
      "text": "development of jaundice and that serum bilirubin should be measured in those at",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        308.5058898925781,
        85.93151092529297,
        321.99591064453125
      ],
      "text": "risk:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        321.5058898925781,
        245.21153259277344,
        334.99591064453125
      ],
      "text": "—\t in all babies if jaundice appears on day 1",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        334.5058898925781,
        317.071533203125,
        347.99591064453125
      ],
      "text": "—\t in preterm babies (<35 weeks) if jaundice appears on day 2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        347.5058898925781,
        289.7115783691406,
        360.99591064453125
      ],
      "text": "—\t in all babies if palms and soles are yellow at any age",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        362.91058349609375,
        256.15283203125,
        376.8305969238281
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        379.1752014160156,
        399.07281494140625,
        392.66522216796875
      ],
      "text": "c)\t Phototherapy should be stopped once serum bilirubin is 50 mmol/l (3 mg/dl) or",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        392.1752014160156,
        206.991455078125,
        405.66522216796875
      ],
      "text": "below the phototherapy threshold.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        407.5798034667969,
        225.62290954589844,
        421.49981689453125
      ],
      "text": "(Weak recommendation, expert opinion)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        434.3921203613281,
        322.7059631347656,
        447.58111572265625
      ],
      "text": "4.5\t Empirical antibiotics for suspected neonatal sepsis",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        451.0177001953125,
        399.12286376953125,
        464.5077209472656
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Neonates with signs of sepsis should be treated with ampicillin (or penicillin) and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        464.0177001953125,
        336.54156494140625,
        477.5077209472656
      ],
      "text": "gentamicin as the first line antibiotic treatment for at least 10 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        479.4223937988281,
        262.9828186035156,
        493.3424072265625
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        495.6869812011719,
        399.0627746582031,
        509.177001953125
      ],
      "text": "b)\tIf a neonate with sepsis is at greater risk of staphylococcus infection (e.g. extensive",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        508.68701171875,
        399.0814514160156,
        522.177001953125
      ],
      "text": "skin pustules, abscess, or omphalitis in addition to signs of sepsis), they should be",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        521.68701171875,
        351.0215148925781,
        535.177001953125
      ],
      "text": "given cloxacillin and gentamicin instead of penicillin and gentamicin.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        537.0916748046875,
        229.02288818359375,
        551.0116577148438
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, expert opinion)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        553.3562622070312,
        399.0326843261719,
        566.8462524414062
      ],
      "text": "c)\t Where possible, blood cultures should be obtained before starting antibiotics. If",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        566.3562622070312,
        399.1114501953125,
        579.8462524414062
      ],
      "text": "an infant does not improve in 2–3 days, antibiotic treatment should be changed,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        579.3562622070312,
        297.33154296875,
        592.8462524414062
      ],
      "text": "or the infant should be referred for further management.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        594.760986328125,
        229.02288818359375,
        608.6809692382812
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, expert opinion)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.61940002441406,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.4224090576172,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "14",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}